This is a small example how to use a BMP280 pressure and temperature sensor with Oxocard Connect and breadbard card.
Look at the image how to wire the sensor on the breadboard.
The code show also how to connect to a i2c device without having the library for easy use. 
The code contaions two algorithm to calculate the values. In my opinion bit shift-bit algorithm get better values. 
I'm not sure, if really correct, butt better than with the floating algorithm. It's possible, that there is already a failure in there.
